app('navrag','implementation','Important control: the released NavRAG DUET branch upweights STOP-target CE by10 (agent.py423–425; agent_base.py141 unreduced CE), while retaining shared softmax normalization. Data conversion samples training starts with replacement from the nearest third of target distances. These are implementation choices that can affect stopping or task difficulty independently of hierarchical RAG. Generation chooses its API model through an external configuration, so exact regeneration also depends on that model/version and responses.')
app('navrag','results','The released shortest-path conversion imposes a goal-oriented route prior even though user-demand language is broad. Demand diversity and route-following fidelity are separate claims; this dataset is not a replacement for non-shortest-path RxR/R4R controls.')
