app('rxr','implementation','Official dataset documentation and schemas were inspected at the pinned RxR commit. VALAN is a related public framework, but its README lists R2R/CVDN/Touchdown rather than verifying the exact RxR multilingual baseline release; this assignment does not mislabel it as an inspected RxR implementation. The paper’s original annotation tool release was prospective; a current primary-source search locates google-research/pangea as the released Guide/Follower collection toolkit, but that toolkit was not executed.')
app('rcm','limitations','The coordinator checked Xin Wang’s primary homepage (https://eric-xw.github.io/), whose RCM entry links paper/video/bibliography but no Code link. Nearby entries explicitly link code. This supports the bounded “official executable implementation not located” status, not a claim of universal nonexistence. The same page lists the TPAMI2020 extension Vision-Language Navigation Policy Learning and Adaptation as a follow-up lead.')

# Keep readable prose, without rewriting URLs or source-code identifiers.
for id,n in notes.items():
    for k in ['problem','method','novelty','results','implementation','limitations']:
        if k in n:
            n[k]=re.sub(r'(?<=[a-z])(?=\d)',' ',n[k])
            n[k]=re.sub(r'(?<=\d)(?=[a-z]{2,}\b)',' ',n[k])
            n[k]=re.sub(r'(?<=[,;])(?=[A-Za-z])',' ',n[k])
    n['repository_status']='Source inspected; no benchmark execution' if n.get('code') else n.get('repository_status','No executable implementation located in bounded search')
    app(id,'implementation','Phase-specific implementation evidence and remaining gaps are indexed in [the assignment01 implementation appendix](../evidence/01/implementation_appendix.md).')
(ROOT/'evidence/01/notes.json').write_text(json.dumps(notes,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),'utf-8')
